For each word below, write ONE short sentence (12 to 22 words) that uses the word itself, spelled in full, in the sense given. Give it voice and mood: a question, someone speaking, a sigh, delight, a warning. No definitions; show the word in a moment of life. Answer as one JSON object mapping each WORD (as given, upper case) to its sentence. JSON only.

RANGE: an area in which something acts or operates or has power or control: "the range of a supersonic jet.
RATHER: on the contrary.
REACTOR: an electrical device used to introduce reactance into a circuit.
REGISTRY: an official written record of names or events or transactions.
RELAY: the act of passing something along from one person or group to another.
RELEASE: merchandise issued for sale or public showing (especially a record or film).
